    "text": "Amarillo\nDid You Grow Up Here? 10 Signs You’re an Amarillo Lifer\nBy Melissa Bartlett,\n2 hours agoMaybe you were born and raised in the Amarillo area. Good for you. Or maybe you are like me and have been here a very long time. I may not be a native, but I have been here since the late eighties. I feel that gives me honorary native status. Fight me if I am wrong.",
